-- Reports live native resources owned by the current process.
public use "resource" function files giving unsigned.
public use "resource" function mapped giving unsigned.
public use "resource" function threads giving unsigned.
-- Accepted callbacks that have not finished, including queued pool work.
public use "resource" function tasks giving unsigned.
-- Pool callbacks accepted but not yet taken by a worker.
public use "resource" function pending giving unsigned.
-- Bytes held by tracked FOO-owned buffers and explicit memory allocations.
public use "resource" function heap giving unsigned.
